  "description": "The ship has been looted. The crew is gone. You are the only one who survived.\n\nDuring the night, pirates attacked the vessel. They took everything of value, destroyed the equipment, and captured the crew. You survived only because you managed to hide in the ship’s dark compartments.\n\nWhen the silence returned, it became clear — there was no one to call for help.\n\nYour first objective is to repair the emergency radio and send a distress signal. The first days of survival will be spent searching for intact parts, restoring power, and making risky trips into damaged sections of the ship.\n\nBut the signal is only the beginning.\n\nRescuers are on their way…\nYou just don’t know when they will arrive.\n\nWhile you wait, the ship slowly dies along with you.\nSupplies are limited, systems continue to fail, and at any moment a fire may break out or another авария may occur. The pirates may return — to check the ship or finish off the one who was left behind.\n\nYou will have to:\n\n- survive by managing hunger and thirst\n\n- extinguish fires and deal with emergencies\n\n- defend yourself against repeated attacks\n\nEvery day is a trial.\n\nYou don’t know how long you must endure.\nYou know only one thing — if you give up too soon, rescue will never come.",
